  "item.maid_smart.combat_leash.desc1": "§7Use on a flying maid to hang beneath her as a gunner; she flies on, you keep shooting",
  "item.maid_smart.combat_leash.desc2": "§7Use again or sneak to release; she drops you safely on landing",
  "item.maid_smart.ride_baton": "Ride Baton",
  "item.maid_smart.ride_baton.desc1": "§7First use on a §fsaddled§7 mount (horse/donkey/pig/strider/camel... or a mod vehicle/dragon) to select it, then use on your maid to pair",
  "item.maid_smart.ride_baton.desc2": "§7Order is §ffixed§7: you must select the §fmount first§7, then the maid. The selected one glows gold",
  "item.maid_smart.ride_baton.desc3": "§7She rides it and follows you; §fsneak + use§7 to dismount. Craft: lead + stick",
  "item.maid_smart.patrol_chart": "Patrol Chart",
  "item.maid_smart.patrol_chart.desc1": "§7In broom mode + home mode, she patrols along a route you draw (replacing the work-circle orbit)",
  "item.maid_smart.patrol_chart.desc2": "§fRight-click§7 to open the chart: create / rename routes, bind maids, start marking, manage marks, connect the loop",
  "item.maid_smart.patrol_chart.desc3": "§fAfter starting marking, middle-click§7 to record a mark (no sneak needed; works in the air and on the ground — the mark is exactly where you are); the diamonds + rings in the world are the marks, each labelled §7\"route #N\"§7 above it (first§bcyan§7 / last§dmagenta); connecting auto-lifts the route over blocking blocks — your marks stay put, only the flown line rises",
  "item.maid_smart.patrol_chart.desc4": "§7Only applies to broom-mode + home-mode maids, and the broom tether no longer pulls her; Craft: paper + compass + ink sac",
